{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/e9e36e5e8fd83712656897c27287aba5.avif?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/50133b7bf3c033d40a600a0b2dc1d352.webp?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombie epidemic caught you off guard. Your only chance for survival? An old school bus and a team of loyal friends. Under the guidance of G, a charismatic radio host and conspiracy theorist, you fight to survive and uncover how to stop the approaching apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a dangerous journey across Fang Island, where despotic General Mahr and the mysterious scientist Anto are locked in a power struggle. Battle for survival, forge unexpected alliances, discover the origins of the apocalypse, and make the choice that will decide the fate of the entire island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/c62b37c15c497d9c47cd2a8fec521b6b.poster.avif?t=1767859125\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/c62b37c15c497d9c47cd2a8fec521b6b.webm?t=1767859125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/c62b37c15c497d9c47cd2a8fec521b6b.mp4?t=1767859125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/c3d041b6a98baeba8ecad764fd6e45de.webp?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive on Fang Island with your team in this co-op action-adventure: fight zombies, craft weapons, customize your bus, and unravel it's secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/d52621dcd71783157a9752e019fd79e2.poster.avif?t=1767859125\" width=780 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/d52621dcd71783157a9752e019fd79e2.webm?t=1767859125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/d52621dcd71783157a9752e019fd79e2.mp4?t=1767859125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/5f1192443143ed7fc1a048cdebc84c3c.webp?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story campaign is designed to work perfectly both in co-op and single-player modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/2471a9ee2ebfa41b3895087e692399d2.avif?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/2ee3377d8b1eaf006fbe18e715b292e5.webp?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your base. Bring back resources gathered during missions; rescue and bring back islanders who will assist you later; craft a variety of fun weapons \u2014 from a garbage-made pistol to a boot on a stick (never underestimate the power of a boot on a stick).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/aee901247df69166fa687d6b82c2c716.avif?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/281c1bb1399834cb618732b81cef9e3f.webp?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your best friend and ultimate vehicle on the island. Customize it however you like: color, decorations, stickers, and even new wheels. And when simple customization isn't enough, you can always add a few turrets and upgrades for effective zombie elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/fbefb56e6c3185859e543854d8f6893b.poster.avif?t=1767859125\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/fbefb56e6c3185859e543854d8f6893b.webm?t=1767859125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/fbefb56e6c3185859e543854d8f6893b.mp4?t=1767859125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're waiting for you on our <strong>Discord server</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/f50c93118504f4c9006a82771ae300ad.avif?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=164 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2852700?t=1767859125","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstati