2852700/extras/2471a9ee2ebfa41b3895087e692399d2.avif?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/2ee3377d8b1eaf006fbe18e715b292e5.webp?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your base. Bring back resources gathered during missions; rescue and bring back islanders who will assist you later; craft a variety of fun weapons \u2014 from a garbage-made pistol to a boot on a stick (never underestimate the power of a boot on a stick).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/aee901247df69166fa687d6b82c2c716.avif?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/281c1bb1399834cb618732b81cef9e3f.webp?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your best friend and ultimate vehicle on the island. Customize it however you like: color, decorations, stickers, and even new wheels. And when simple customization isn't enough, you can always add a few turrets and upgrades for effective zombie elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/fbefb56e6c3185859e543854d8f6893b.poster.avif?t=1767859125\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/fbefb56e6c3185859e543854d8f6893b.webm?t=1767859125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/fbefb56e6c3185859e543854d8f6893b.mp4?t=1767859125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're waiting for you on our <strong>Discord server</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/extras/f50c93118504f4c9006a82771ae300ad.avif?t=1767859125\" width=600 height=164 /></span></p>","developers":["Herbarium Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852700/21a807979f816a0780d309052e94059b9c29038c/header.jpg?t=1767859125","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2852700/682686/82ea57011a182c1cc3a961e5916b6382afe9148d/1750947702/dash_av1.mpd?t=1712157378","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2852700/682686/82ea57011a182c1cc3a961e5916b6382afe9148d/1750947702/dash_h264.mpd?t=1712157378","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2852700/682686/82ea57011a182c1cc3a961e5916b6382afe9148d/1750947702/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1712157378","id":257012950,"name":"BUS: Bro U Survived | Game Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257012950/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1712157378"}],"name":"BUS: Bro u Survived","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operatin